WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:03.362
About ten years ago, I 
left all people behind

00:00:04.131 --> 00:00:06.318
and went into the 
wilderness alone.

00:00:06.318 --> 00:00:09.551
I've learned that change 
is always happening

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:11.720
but I've learned to be more 
at peace with that

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:13.645
because that's how nature works.

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:18.291
I've learned that change 
doesn't happen by pushing

00:00:18.291 --> 00:00:20.401
but by making room.

00:00:20.895 --> 00:00:23.857
I've learned to step back 
and see patterns

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:26.860
and to work with what's under 
the surface of things.

00:00:27.485 --> 00:00:31.646
And all of the time, all of the time,
I'm learning to care more.

00:00:32.407 --> 00:00:35.744
We're the first generations, 
perhaps with the responsibility

00:00:35.744 --> 00:00:38.335
to define leadership on behalf 
of our whole planet.

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:42.000
We're the first generations,
perhaps on the edge

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.131
of seeing the destruction
of our whole world.

00:00:45.514 --> 00:00:48.590
So what is leadership now?

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:50.675
Well, I think it's a choice.

00:00:50.675 --> 00:00:53.094
It's a choice to come back 
and challenge

00:00:53.094 --> 00:00:56.890
everything and redefine it 
using the rules of nature.

